# Perf baseline — ⟨topic⟩

> trunk_sha: ⟨short or full⟩  
> config_id: ⟨cfg-id or experimental⟩  
> protocol: ⟨measurement protocol refs⟩  
> status: current  
> vs: ⟨bl-trunk-… or n/a⟩

Copy to `poc/<topic>/ndf/PERF_BASELINE.md`. TOPIC MUST set `perf_baseline:` after R0 ([[META-007]]).

## Config

- Prefer a named config id under the product verification tree (`configs/cfg-*.md`)
- If experimental: paste **full** measurement env / knobs here (MUST NOT “see NOTES”)

## Numbers

Either:

1. **Reuse trunk golden**: state “reuse `baselines/<vs>.md`” and link it, or  
2. **Topic R0 table**: matrix of scenarios × metrics (sole source for Δ% narrative)

## Notes

Measurement caveats only. Do not hide a second “real baseline” elsewhere.
